[step 6] $ /sbin/ldconfig -p | grep -E 'libcuda|libcudart|libcublas'
	libcudadebugger.so.1 (libc6,x86-64) => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libcudadebugger.so.1
	libcuda.so.1 (libc6,x86-64) => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libcuda.so.1
	libcuda.so (libc6,x86-64) => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libcuda.so
expected: a line for libcuda.so.1; for each of libcudart.so.13 libcublas.so.13 libcublasLt.so.13, a line or a file in /home/tester/cuda-13.2.86/nvidia/cu13/lib
got:      a line for libcuda.so.1; only in /home/tester/cuda-13.2.86/nvidia/cu13/lib: libcudart.so.13 libcublas.so.13 libcublasLt.so.13
cp_commit and cp_prove will find these only through a run path (rpath) to that directory,
which prover/build.sh sets under the conditions in prover/docs/build.md. If it sets none, it says
so only when it ends, in about half an hour, and this script then stops.

[step 7] $ grep -m1 -ow sha_ni /proc/cpuinfo
sha_ni
expected: sha_ni
got:      sha_ni

[step 8] $ grep -sE '^(MemAvailable:|inactive_file|active_file) +[0-9]+( kB)?$' /proc/meminfo /sys/fs/cgroup/memory.stat; grep -s . /sys/fs/cgroup/memory.max /sys/fs/cgroup/memory.current /sys/fs/cgroup/memory/memory.limit_in_bytes
